    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter",
        "text": "You! What are you looking at?! Too scared to fight us?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter",
        "text": "Whoever you are, you lost the guts to take us on now? Too scared of Patriot's blood? Scared of his witchcraft?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter",
        "text": "Thinking back to the time you fought the Sarkaz? You had them outnumbered, you could've won, but in the end you just ran up the casualties!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter",
        "text": "But we'll do you one better! You can't break our shields, you can't crack our armor! You're nothing before the undying Patriot!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter",
        "text": "The mightiest Ursus warrior... needs no spear or shield. He'll stomp you to pieces."
